OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 24 MAR
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GMark Forrest introduces specially
OL,11,     Gmade recordings of orchestral
OL,12,     Gmusic from Prague and chamber
OL,13,     Gmusic from Vaughan-WIlliams and
OL,14,     Ghis contemporaries from LSO St
OL,15,     GLuke's in London.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Thomas Ades
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod talks to Thomas
OL,18,     GAdes about his second opera,
OL,19,     Gbased on Shakespeare's The
OL,20,     GTempest, and the unique creative
OL,21,     Gprocess of writing for the stage.
